@startuml
[*] --> TimeAdjustmentMode : Initial State

TimeAdjustmentMode --> AlarmSettingMode : Press Button 1, then press Button 2
AlarmSettingMode --> TimeAdjustmentMode : Press Button 1, then release Button 2
TimeAdjustmentMode --> LightOnMode : Press Light Control Button and hold
LightOnMode --> TimeAdjustmentMode : Release Light Control Button

AlarmSettingMode --> AlarmOffMode : Turn Alarm Off
AlarmOffMode --> [*] : Set Alarm Time
AlarmSettingMode --> [*] : Current Time Matches Alarm Time

TimeAdjustmentMode --> StopAlarmMode : Press Stop Alarm Button
StopAlarmMode --> TimeAdjustmentMode : Stop Alarm Confirmed

[*] --> EndState : Final State

@enduml
